Package: statusbar
Version: 0.5.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, tar, zig
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vrypan/statusbar
Description: Terminal status bar that keeps useful information visible
 A status bar at the bottom of your terminal. It keeps useful information
 visible while you work, without repeating it in every prompt. Your shell,
 full-screen programs, and scrollback continue to work.
 Built from source for Termux, with runtime paths moved off Android's
 read-only /tmp. Ships statusbar and statusbar-theme, an interactive theme
 picker with 12 bundled themes.
